e, and cell cycle phase using Normalized Mutual Information (NMI).

\section{Results}
\subsection{Clustering Performance}
Leiden clustering with the selected resolution (0.4) produced 17 clusters. The cluster size distribution ranged from 152 cells (cluster 15) to 9,017 cells (cluster 10). The silhouette coefficient was 0.216, with a median silhouette of 0.216 across seeds.

